# The caveats section is located by a `^## ` heading match, and a README checked out with CRLF
# line endings reports as having no such heading at all -- so the entrypoint aborts with
# `CaveatsSectionMissing` on a file that plainly contains it. Verified. This is not cosmetic:
# it is a stranger on Windows being told the honesty section is missing when it is not.
README.md text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.jsonl text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
